<title>NETHERLANDS: VILENZO 1996 NET UP ON ONE-OFF GAIN.</title>
<headline>VILENZO 1996 NET UP ON ONE-OFF GAIN.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     3.79 vs   3.67</p>
<p>    Net profit			     9.8  vs   9.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.90 vs   1.84</p>
<p>    Turnover			     128.5  vs 117.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Textiles group Vilenzo NV said its 1996 net included</p>
<p>a previously announced 2.4 million guilders extrordinary gain on</p>
<p>the sale of property. The company previously said it expected</p>
<p>the 1996 net profit to at least equal 1995's.</p>
<p>Vilenzo did not give a forecast for 1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
